{"id": "1535133097912303676", "channel_id": "1534858900522664026", "author_id": "718101727093456958", "author_name": "watchthew0rldburn", "content": "exalt:\nMaw of Hell(stating it as an object), opened and waiting > Maw of Hell(addressing it as if it were a person), open for me\n\nshort blade:\nThe sea of stars witnesses destruction(implied meaning to me is \"the sea of stars witnesses MY destruction\") > sea of stars(again, as if a person), witness destruction(command tone)\n\nlong blade:\nbe honoured of the fact that you're fighting against  *me*(watashi which is normal way to say me and pretty humble as averag) > be honoured of the fact that you're fighting against  *me*(ware is a very haughty and mighty way to address one's self, usually used by those of rightfully arrogant like deities in JP fiction, with some exceptions)\n\nThe first two changes sound better in English, but in JP, IMO the original better fits GLotan as a deity, cuz she doesn't have to command the Maw of Hell and Sea of Stars to open up and witness respectively, they're already doing it on-demand, without verbally having to demand it.", "timestamp": "2026-08-07T03:50:51.936000+00:00", "type": 19, "thread_id": "1534858900522664026", "mentions": ["98433556354699264"], "reactions": [{"emoji": "🎉", "emoji_id": null, "count": 4}], "reply_to": "1535000664361537637", "thread_title": "Lotan: Cetarchon voice lines after update V2.5.3.3", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1361169005435420785"]}
