{"id": "1535134007879139350", "channel_id": "1534858900522664026", "author_id": "718101727093456958", "author_name": "watchthew0rldburn", "content": "the main and biggest issue is still the major shift in tone, though\nold gave the vibe of proud, loud and battle-hungry warrior who's getting her tension heightened due to the heat of the battle(especially with her ult being likely the climax and finishing move thematically)\n\nwhile new gives more of a smirking, mocking, squashing ants slightly sadistically kind of feel, which can work, but notably, GLotan *doesn't* care about squashing ants, she has made it VERY clear she wants fight strong things and cares NOT about ants and their trifles", "timestamp": "2026-08-07T03:54:28.889000+00:00", "thread_id": "1534858900522664026", "thread_title": "Lotan: Cetarchon voice lines after update V2.5.3.3", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1361169005435420785"]}
